{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a69d3bfeac6d9159fbd3725823f033113e9e01341a14c1279c94696a3b77fe32", "ja": "（アイドル達と行ったグランピングから帰って来た。\nさて、留守の間に溜まった仕事をやらないとな……）", "zh": "（和偶像们参加的豪华露营结束，回来了。好了，得处理一下我不在时积攒下来的工作了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "7668fd95566c6cb67da704f9f3884650149fbc5cacb4b81d2e97b59e3ae9b061", "ja": "おやぶん発見～っ♪　ねぇねぇ……。\nあっ、もしかして今、お仕事忙しかったりする？", "zh": "发现老大啦～♪　那个那个……  \n啊，难道你现在工作很忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1002_p", "source_sha256": "06f6679bef2ef56933a2a12dfe822290b37bdf2cb777280d8d587595bc1e81e8", "ja": "ん？　環か。そうだな、今日はかなり忙しいな……。\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？是小环啊。是啊，今天确实挺忙的……\n怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "cd205f934c6ce0f506217a751cfbfbfae3dd8641c96bd8d68950298f3695509f", "ja": "そっか……ううん、なんでもない！\nあのね、今、みんなで野球してるんだ～。", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，没什么！\n那个，我们现在正在一起打棒球呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d9eacd843f207a37379ae43b53ebe5eb42343932d38ea3bcd02eb24db73014b3", "ja": "ああ、そういえば外がにぎやかだった気が……。", "zh": "啊，这么说来，外面好像确实挺热闹的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "ecd54803e2a93dd2f5eb265e804d782b773e212796684372eb385f75af6c9aeb", "ja": "うん！　おやぶん知ってる？　すばるって\nすごいんだよ！　投げた球が、ギュンって曲がるの。", "zh": "嗯！老大，你知道吗？昴可厉害了！她投出去的球会“嗖”地拐弯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "ff3b0775c6a162ed3959d22cc0b56b574b861e57ae788e165414c9d4289e21e8", "ja": "うみみはダッシュがすごいし、\nまつりはね、ホームランをたくさん打つんだぞ～！", "zh": "海美的冲刺很厉害，\n小祭还会打出很多全垒打呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "0ba1c9360f755e4b10b62178054047a4b18ad6de9f763e97b9406eaf56541ef4", "ja": "あとね、あとね……あっ、ごめんなさい！\nおやぶん、お仕事だった。", "zh": "还有，还有……啊，对不起！\n老大，你还在工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "59a110917e864ac504c87228ce516889cfdcbf9b7780cd7a9493a08f2c3ace61", "ja": "じゃあたまき、戻るね。またあとでね。\n……。", "zh": "那小环先回去了。待会儿见。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a2edab833ac2d85b3d4d5dae850b5ecb8df0c0162cf17728acfbc030936c601c", "ja": "環？　ええと、そうだな……。\n俺もちょっとだけ、遊びに行こうかな。", "zh": "环？呃，这个嘛……。\n我也去玩一会儿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "a80272c3f14dfc665b9bf27621d4e4daec542b37ca7e477fcdbfacda892d93bb", "ja": "えっ！？　いいの！？", "zh": "诶！？可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5c30155cef32f63aebc664c104714e43821e4518317f59d174013d42702a6b7c", "ja": "ああ、ちょっと息抜きしたいところだったし。\n丁度よかったよ。", "zh": "嗯，我正好也想稍微放松一下。\n来得正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "488d78421e6c3c3262935de9315b731df26a9ef4aca252f495973bec531e4509", "ja": "やったーっ！　おやぶんありがとう～♪\nたまき、一緒に遊びたかったんだ～。", "zh": "太好啦——！谢谢老大～♪\n环一直想和你一起玩呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "5a3f7958701f87676a7c1ac5164ad759b9302640b4d696bd4fac18f5ac81e5f7", "ja": "おやぶんにカッコイイところ、見せたいぞ～！\nホームラン打てるように、がんばらなきゃ♪", "zh": "想让老大看看我帅气的一面～！\n为了能打出全垒打，得加油才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0283_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "09cdfa8cdaa32eec7f133886e030fa8d558f80eb8d2c7d9383f1c5edd45319d3", "ja": "あ、遊び終わったら、ちゃんとレッスンもするからね！\nくふふ♪　楽しみだぞ～！", "zh": "啊，玩完之后也会好好训练的哦！\n嘿嘿♪ 真期待呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
